      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Daniel%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Rancher Thomas P. Daniel founded the town in 1900, originally building a log store with a sod roof to serve early travelers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        4,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
